      "skillOrderNotes": {
        "interleave": "Two-source rules (docs/research/2026-10-templar-pack.md §4.2: mmo-codex, daevaguides): Judgment is the first point sink, Vicious Strike is raised early and Punishment comes later; Fury (21) goes to 10 the level it is learned (flat gate, so it is listed after the core seven, where the flat gate applies). Where Pummel, Shield Smite and Warding Strike sit is not agreed (mmo-codex: Shield Smite and Warding Strike third and fourth; daevaguides: Pummel with the first two); the order between those rules is inferred.",
        "budget": "Core seven to Lv 10 = 7 × 21 = 147 points; Fury to 10 = 21 (168); Ironclad Defense to 5 = 5 (173); Annihilate to 7 = 9, Enhance Health to 8 = 13, Poach to 5 = 5 (200). LEVEL_POINTS[45] = 203 (Metabot; aion2turkiye agrees) plus Wisdom Stones."
      },
